                <!-- =====================================================
                     FEATURE SECTION: AI & CONVERSATIONAL
                ====================================================== -->
                <section id="ai-conversational" class="dics-kb-section">
                    <div class="dics-container">
                        <div class="dics-kb-article">
                            <div class="dics-kb-article__head">
                                <span class="dics-kb-eyebrow">GAME-CHANGING INNOVATION</span>
                                <h2>1. AI Moves From Feature to Working Partner &amp; Conversational Workflows</h2>
                            </div>
                            <div class="dics-kb-article__body">
                                <p>
                                    In Odoo 20, the key question is no longer "does Odoo have AI?" — it already did.
                                    The more important shift is where AI becomes part of the <em>everyday workflow</em>.
                                    Odoo 20 introduces a dedicated Conversational AI layer, AI-assisted website and
                                    eCommerce creation, and AI-powered content optimisation across the platform.
                                </p>

                                <div class="dics-mg-callout dics-mg-callout--note">
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">lightbulb</span>
                                    <div>
                                        <strong>Key Feature: Conversational AI — A New Way to Work</strong>
                                        <p>
                                            Instead of navigating menu after menu, users can instruct Odoo in plain
                                            language: <em>"Show me all quotations from ABC Ltd that haven't been
                                            confirmed"</em> or <em>"Create a follow-up activity for these
                                            customers."</em> Odoo 20's conversational layer maps natural speech to
                                            business logic, permissions, and record operations in real time.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <p>Key AI capabilities introduced or deepened in Odoo 20:</p>

                                <ul class="dics-kb-list dics-kb-list--good" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                                    <li>
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span>
                                        <strong>AI-Assisted Content Generation:</strong>
                                        Automatically produce product titles, descriptions, marketing copy, and SEO
                                        text — removing repetitive writing tasks so employees focus on decisions
                                        instead of typing.
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span>
                                        <strong>AI-Powered Website Optimisation:</strong>
                                        Intelligently suggest layout improvements, SEO refinements, and promotional
                                        content based on visitor behaviour and catalogue data.
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span>
                                        <strong>Conversational Record Operations:</strong>
                                        Trigger CRM lead assignments, activity creation, status changes, and field
                                        updates using plain-language instructions — all respecting existing Odoo
                                        access rights, record rules, and business logic.
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

