                     FEATURE SECTION: OFFLINE MODE
                ====================================================== -->
                <section id="offline-mode" class="dics-kb-section dics-kb-section--gray">
                    <div class="dics-container">
                        <div class="dics-kb-engineering">
                            <div class="dics-kb-engineering__copy">
                                <span class="dics-kb-eyebrow">OPERATIONAL RESILIENCE</span>
                                <h2>2. Odoo Goes Offline — Sync Queue &amp; Conflict Management</h2>
                                <p>
                                    One of the most impactful announcements for Odoo 20 is a dedicated Offline Mode.
                                    Field employees, warehouse workers, and sales teams can now continue working when
                                    connectivity disappears — and sync all changes the moment a connection returns.
                                </p>

                                <div class="dics-kb-pillars">
                                    <article>
                                        <span>01</span>
                                        <div>
                                            <h3>Full Record Operations Offline</h3>
                                            <p>Browse, search, create, edit, archive, unarchive, and delete records
                                                entirely without an internet connection.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </article>
                                    <article>
                                        <span>02</span>
                                        <div>
                                            <h3>Synchronisation Queue &amp; Monitoring</h3>
                                            <p>Pending changes queue automatically on reconnection. Built-in tools
                                                let admins inspect, manage, and resolve the queue in real time.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </article>
                                    <article>
                                        <span>03</span>
                                        <div>
                                            <h3>Conflict Resolution Framework</h3>
                                            <p>When two users modify the same record offline, Odoo 20's conflict
                                                tools surface the discrepancy and provide structured resolution — not
                                                a silent overwrite.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </article>
                                </div>
                            </div>

