                                <h3>ORM Changes &amp; Removed APIs</h3>
                                <p><code>Model._table_query</code> is removed in Odoo 20. Binary fields gain
                                    <code>BinaryValue.filename</code> with an updated RPC format. Translation
                                    handling is simplified. Any custom module touching these patterns needs
                                    review before upgrade.</p>
                            </article>

                            <article>
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">api</span>
                                <h3>JSON-2 API — Migrate Now</h3>
                                <p>XML-RPC and JSON-RPC are deprecated. The database service is removed in
                                    Odoo 20; the common and object services are scheduled for removal in
                                    Odoo 22. Every external integration — Shopify connectors, mobile apps,
                                    BI pipelines — must migrate to JSON-2 bearer-auth endpoints.</p>
